data: {"id": "7ce43a165d2a4c5b-thinking-parallel_evidence-857", "run_id": "7ce43a165d2a4c5b", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Kubernetes 生命周期 (kubectl_describe + events)\n- **状态**: Pending，`CreateContainerConfigError` 持续约 48 分钟（事件：46m，×12 over 48m）。\n- **错误原文**: `Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in ConfigMap aiops-case-v11/workload-input`\n- **容器**: `app`，镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，命令 `python3 -u -c \"import time; ... time.sleep(86400)\"`。\n- **Restart Count**: 0（从未成功启动）。\n- **Node**: `node2`，Pod IP `172.16.104.26`。\n- **Volumes**: 无 VolumeMount（Events 中的 ConfigMap 是通过 Env", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789148176758, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

