data: {"id": "7ce43a165d2a4c5b-final", "run_id": "7ce43a165d2a4c5b", "seq": 862, "ts_ms": 1789148195299, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v11/workload` | CreateContainerConfigError | Pod aiops-case-v11/workload 持续处于 Pending 状态，容器 app 报 CreateContainerConfigError 无法启动 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `kubernetes` (fact-70c7dd428576) | `Warning Failed 46m (x12 over 48m) kubelet Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in ConfigMap aiops-case-v11/workload-input` | 确认为 kubelet 校验失败，直接归因为配置引用缺失 |\n| 2 | Metric | `prometheus` (fact-54930c094d8d) | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{container=\"app\", reason=\"CreateContainerConfigError\"} = 1` | 独立证实容器持续卡在配置加载阶段，状态与 Event 一致 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | `kubernetes` (fact-07bed9314030) | `resource_limit.memory: 32Mi` | 确认容器资源限制，排除因资源超限导致的非配置类失败 |\n| 4 | K8s State | `kubernetes` (fact-22c8b17b2f13) | `pod.status: Pending` | 证实 Pod 未进入 Running 状态，与配置报错机制吻合 |\n| 5 | Metric | `prometheus` (fact-f5207b304661) | `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{container=\"app\"} = 0` | 证实容器从未成功启动过，排除因容器崩溃重启导致的连锁故障 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\nK8s Event (证据1) 明确指出了失败原因是 ConfigMap 中找不到 key 'unavailable-key'；Metric (证据2) 独立验证了该 Pod 处于 `CreateContainerConfigError` 状态。资源配置 (证据3) 和重启计数 (证据5) 进一步排除了其他可能性，锁定为配置挂载阶段的校验失败。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 定义引用了 ConfigMap aiops-case-v11/workload-input 中不存在的 key 'unavailable-key' → kubelet 启动前校验配置失败 → 容器启动被阻止，持续重试并报错 → Pod 长期处于 CreateContainerConfigError 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 **Pod 配置引用了 ConfigMap `aiops-case-v11/workload-input` 中不存在的 key `unavailable-key`**。\n\n该配置错误导致 kubelet 在启动容器前发现配置引用错误（证据1），直接阻止了容器创建。Prometheus 监控数据（证据2）与 K8s 状态（证据4）一致证实了 Pod 长期处于 `CreateContainerConfigError` 等待状态，且从未成功启动（证据5），确认了根因的持续性和排他性。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 14.2s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 41.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v11/workload: 41.8s (Evidence 32.7s, RCA 9.0s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.4s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v11/workload**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 65.374, "metrics": {"run_id": "7ce43a165d2a4c5b", "mttr": {"value": "1.1m", "seconds": 65.37623333930969, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 65376.23333930969, "llm_calls": 15, "llm_duration_ms": 61618.48449707031, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 13, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 11, "failed_tool_calls": 4, "tool_duration_ms": 7880.267858505249, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3434.922933578491}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 14150.187015533447, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 41837.581157684326, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 9362.233638763428, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

